sar noukay sina se sarwar ka<br>
quran ki tilawat karta hai<br>
ghar baar luta kar karbal mein<br>
elaan e wilayat karta hai,<br>
<br>
1. islaam ko zinda karna tha ummat ko jagana tha<br>
sheh ko,<br>
tauheed ki shamma jalti rahe duniya ko dekhana<br>
tha sheh ko,<br>
islaam bachakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
2. tauheed ki qatir sarwar ne sar apna kataya<br>
jungle mein,<br>
baba ki wilayat ki qatir khoon apna bahaya jungle<br>
mein,<br>
gardan ko katakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
3. rehjati payamber ki mehnat gar sar na katatay<br>
sajde mein,<br>
tauheed bachane shahey deen gar khoon na<br>
bahate sajde mein,<br>
tauheed bachakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
4. gardan bhi katey kunba bhi loutey islaam<br>
bachana tha sheh ko,<br>
har haal mein deen e ahmed ka paigaam sunana<br>
tha sheh ko,<br>
gulshan ko loutakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
5. jab nouke sina se shahey deen quran ki tilawat<br>
karte they,<br>
surey ki tilawat sun sun kar abid bhi aahein bharte<br>
they,<br>
quran sunakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat karta<br>
hai.<br>
<br>
6. baiyat ke gale ko kata hai hatoon ko katakar<br>
gaazi ne,<br>
shabbir ke maqsad ki qatir jaan kardi nichawar<br>
gaazi ne,<br>
maqsad ko bachakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
7. islaam ki qatir sarwar ne akber ki jawani de<br>
daali,<br>
baba ki wilayat ki qatir tasveer nabi ki de daali,<br>
akber ko gawaankar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
8. ghode se gira jab qasim to sar peet ke sarwar<br>
rote they,<br>
bhai ki nashani ke gham mein jaan apni moula<br>
khote they,<br>
tukdoon ko uthakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
9. chey maah ke asghar ko dekar islaam ko zinda<br>
karna tha,<br>
shabbir ko apne nana ke paigam ko zinda karna<br>
tha,<br>
laashe ko uthakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.<br>
<br>
10. jab hashmi nouha likhta hai sub ahle aza ye<br>
kehte hain,<br>
padhta hai raza jo nouha toh har aankh se aansu<br>
behte hai,<br>
gharbaar lutakar karbal mein elaan e wilayat<br>
karta hai.